# Dimir Spybug: "Whenever you surveil" triggers once the surveil is done "even if some or all of those actions were
# impossible" (CR 701.25d; the ruling: "It even triggers if you have no cards in your library"). Bot1's deck is its
# opening hand and nothing else. On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Spybug with Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet and plays Meticulous
# Archive: its enters trigger surveils 1 with an empty library, so nothing is looked at (`! Bot1.Arrange`), and the
# Spybug still triggers and gets its counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Dimir Spybug
Meticulous Archive
Island
Island
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dimir Spybug.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Meticulous Archive.Play
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Arrange
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Dimir Spybug.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Dimir Spybug.Power = 2
